# MyAppAI — Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Deliberate rules only. There is deliberately NO /* catch-all: Pages'
# validator ignores splat -> /index.html rules as infinite loops (the old
# file parsed as 0 valid + 1 invalid), and with dist/404.html present
# (scripts/generate-404.mjs, run as postbuild) unmatched paths are served
# 404.html with a genuine 404 status.
#
# This app is a pure SPA — no route is prerendered — so every genuine
# route below gets an explicit rewrite to the app shell at its own URL.
# The rewrite target is / (the directory index): a /index.html target is
# discarded by the validator, per the findmerates fix. Route list mirrors
# frontend/src/App.jsx; anything not listed here is a dead path and 404s.
/about / 200
/about/ / 200
/contact / 200
/contact/ / 200
/privacy / 200
/privacy/ / 200
/tools / 200
/tools/ / 200
/openclaw / 200
/openclaw/ / 200
/revenue / 200
/revenue/ / 200
/blog / 200
/blog/ / 200
/blog/* / 200
/referral/* / 200
/admin / 200
/admin/login / 200
/admin/* / 200
